        <section aria-labelledby="setup"><h2 id="setup" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-100">1. Resettable engineering workspace</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-gray-400">Create a copy. It is course-owned and disposable; no React, JSX, API, or database setup belongs here.</p><pre class="mt-5 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-[#111019] p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[#d9c9ff]"><code>mkdir -p .dalt/workspace
